Books API — Lab08

❏ books
↳ GET /books returns 200 with an array
  GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/books [200 OK, 166B, 46ms]
  ✓  status is 200
  ✓  body is an array

↳ POST /books creates a book (201) and stores book_id
  POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/books [201 CREATED, 258B, 4ms]
  ✓  status is 201
  ✓  id is a positive number

↳ GET /books/{id} returns the created book with 5 fields
  GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/books/1 [200 OK, 233B, 2ms]
  ✓  status is 200
  ✓  has exactly the 5 Book fields

↳ PUT /books/{id} replaces the title
  PUT http://127.0.0.1:5000/books/1 [200 OK, 241B, 4ms]
  ✓  status is 200
  ✓  title was updated

↳ DELETE /books/{id} returns 204 with empty body
  DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5000/books/1 [204 NO CONTENT, 160B, 2ms]
  ✓  status is 204
  ✓  body is empty

❏ error-cases
↳ POST /books without title returns 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
  POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/books [400 BAD REQUEST, 306B, 1ms]
  ✓  status is 400
  ✓  body has code VALIDATION_ERROR and a message
  ✓  errors[] mentions field title

↳ GET /books/9999 returns 404 NOT_FOUND
  GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/books/9999 [404 NOT FOUND, 219B, 2ms]
  ✓  status is 404
  ✓  body has code NOT_FOUND and a message
  ✓  response is JSON

